	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Summarize the active window or the clipboard with Claude, or any other command that reads text on stdin and writes a summary to stdout.

Type the keyword (default: sum) and pick a row:
  Active window   the selection or page text in Safari, Chrome or Brave, or the selected message in Mail
  Clipboard       the clipboard text, or the web page when the clipboard holds one URL

The summary streams into a Text View. Press ⌘C to copy it.

Page text and mail bodies go to whatever the configured command talks to. With the default command, that is Anthropic's API through Claude Code.

Requires Alfred 5.5 or later and a logged-in claude command (run claude once in a terminal).</string>
